{"title": "Neural Apparatus", "pageid": 58286, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Neural_Apparatus", "categories": ["Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:NeuralApparatus.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/NeuralApparatus.png/300px-NeuralApparatus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/NeuralApparatus.png/450px-NeuralApparatus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/bb/NeuralApparatus.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/NeuralApparatus.png/300px-NeuralApparatus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"449\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/NeuralApparatus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Neural Apparatus</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Neural Apparatuses</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid\">Illithid</a> devices which can have different functions. Some are used to operate elevator platforms, while others can be used to control <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Pod\" title=\"Mind Flayer Pod\">Mind Flayer Pods</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Prologue\">Prologue</span></h3>\n<p>Inside the <a href=\"/wiki/Escape_the_Nautiloid#Surgery_Room\" title=\"Escape the Nautiloid\">Surgery room</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nautiloid</a> a Neural Apparatus operates the elevator platform. It allows access to an upper level. On the upper level, a <a href=\"/wiki/High_Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Elf\">high elf</a> named <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Myrnath\" title=\"Myrnath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Portrait_Myrnath.png/25px-Portrait_Myrnath.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Portrait_Myrnath.png/38px-Portrait_Myrnath.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Portrait_Myrnath.png/50px-Portrait_Myrnath.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Myrnath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Portrait_Myrnath.png/25px-Portrait_Myrnath.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Portrait_Myrnath.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Myrnath\" title=\"Myrnath\">Myrnath</a> can be found with a removed scalp, his exposed brain telepathically pleading for help.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Two\">Act Two</span></h3>\n<p>One Neural Apparatus is in the <a href=\"/wiki/Tadpoling_Centre\" title=\"Tadpoling Centre\">Tadpoling Centre</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a>. It operates the nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Pod\" title=\"Mind Flayer Pod\">Mind Flayer Pods</a>; some of them are empty, some already keep newly created mind flayers, while others contain characters whom the party has met previously in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zevlor\" title=\"Zevlor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/25px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/38px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/50px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zevlor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/25px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zevlor\" title=\"Zevlor\">Zevlor</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yeva\" title=\"Yeva\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Portrait_Yeva.png/25px-Portrait_Yeva.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Portrait_Yeva.png/38px-Portrait_Yeva.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Portrait_Yeva.png/50px-Portrait_Yeva.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gauntlet Yeva\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Portrait_Yeva.png/25px-Portrait_Yeva.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Portrait_Yeva.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Yeva\" title=\"Yeva\">Gauntlet Yeva</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shuurga\" title=\"Shuurga\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Shuurga.png/25px-Portrait_Shuurga.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Shuurga.png/38px-Portrait_Shuurga.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Shuurga.png/50px-Portrait_Shuurga.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Manip Shuurga\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Shuurga.png/25px-Portrait_Shuurga.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Shuurga.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shuurga\" title=\"Shuurga\">Manip Shuurga</a>. The party can free or kill characters in the pods with the Neural Apperatus.\n</p><p>Another apparatus  is in the eastern part of the colony and allows the party to use a moving platform to <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony#Advance_to_Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">advance towards Ketheric Thorm</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_locations\">Related locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nautiloid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nautiloid</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tadpoling_Centre\" title=\"Tadpoling Centre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tadpoling Centre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Tadpoling_Centre\" title=\"Tadpoling Centre\">Tadpoling Centre</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195438\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: